ecause when you look at their  story they probably started with less  than what you have right now and in  studying them you can see oh if they  could do it maybe I can too it's just  that hope because you don't see anybody  in your family your friend's Circle  doing what you want to do and so it  feels impossible but when you're around  the people who are doing it even just by  reading their book or watching their  videos it gives you the hope that it's  possible and then two it gives you the  strategy of what you could be doing so  how do you go from where you are now to  where you want to be well if you're  modeling success and you see what they  did it gives you hope plus the strategy  to actually go off and execute so coming  back to the theme of failure what this  video is all about you're gonna have  tons of failure it's gonna happen like  if you are not failing it means you're  not taking a big enough shot right if  you're not failing you're just doing  things that you know how to do  therefore you're just in your comfort  zone therefore you just hate your life  right if you're not if you have zero  failure happening in your life then  you're taking zero chances and you're  just doing what you know how to do and  you'll be bored and you won't like your  life so recognize that failure is a part  of the process and as soon as we can  move from past I suck as a human I made  all these mistakes too okay I'm moving  forward we're making progress we got a  big thing that we're chasing down when  you can move from failure to progress it  gives you the momentum it gives you the  hope it gives you the energy and ends up  giving you a lot better results as well  one of my favorite studies about  exercise and they had three cohorts in  this study so they have first cohort  they said I just want you to track how  often you work out over the next few  weeks right so that's the the standard  cohort the control group second group is  that we want to track off new exercise 